{"id":"prosto","lemma":"просто","pos":"adv","rank":30,"glosses":["simply, plainly, just"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Просто скажи мне, что это.","en":"Just tell me what it is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283268","words":[null,{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]},{"text":"Мы просто друзья?","en":"We're just friends?","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Мы можем просто пойти домой?","en":"Can we just go home?","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"to go"},{"g":"home"}]},{"text":"Это невозможно или просто трудно?","en":"Is it impossible or just hard?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"it is impossible"},{"g":"or"},null,{"g":"it is difficult, hard"}]},{"text":"Просто скажите нет.","en":"Just say no.","words":[null,{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"no / there isn't"}]}]}